Promote the safe compact-mobile Home Quote Check restoration to production.

This release restores the compact mobile hero after the previous DOM-rewrite implementation was rolled back for a blank-screen regression. The replacement is deliberately style-only: it does not destructively replace the application DOM, keeps the existing Home Quote Check app and upload flow intact, and reduces mobile hero height while retaining the approved house-only artwork, independence messaging and the primary “Check my quote — free” action.

Mobile presentation now uses a single-column hero, a 1.94:1 artwork area capped at 250px, and hides the non-essential hero steps overlay on narrow screens so the quote-check action appears earlier without removing product or trust content.

